    "hint_texts": "This part concentrates on refactoring and cleaning up the argument handling in contour functions. Revise the _contour_args and _check_xyz functions so that the new boolean auto-detection logic is seamlessly integrated. Focus on a more robust and clear unpacking of the input arguments to support both boolean and non-boolean arrays while ensuring backward compatibility. The refactoring should isolate the core changes related to boolean detection from the rest of the argument processing logic.",
    "entrypoint": "Edit the file lib/matplotlib/contour.py, specifically the _contour_args and _check_xyz functions, to update argument unpacking and processing. Also modify the file lib/matplotlib/tri/_tricontour.py in the _contour_args function so that the call to _process_contour_level_args correctly passes the data type (z.dtype) for proper processing.",
